    .string "从西尔佛大楼仓皇逃窜！$"

SaffronCity_Text_ImASecurityGuard::
    .string "我是一名保安。\p"
    .string "我决不允许可疑的孩子进入！$"

SaffronCity_Text_HesTakingASnooze::
    .string "……\n"
    .string "鼾声传了出来……\p"
    .string "哈！他正在打盹儿！$"

